## Layout

```
services/{{service}}/
├── contracts/         # {{service}}-contracts (public)
├── service/           # {{service}}-service (private implementation)
│   ├── migrations/    # own Alembic env
│   ├── tests/
│   └── src/{{service}}_service/   (layout below)
├── observability/     # slo.yaml, alerts, dashboards, runbook — travels with the service
└── Dockerfile

src/{{service}}_service/
├── module.py          # the single door used by the composition root
├── settings.py        # {{SERVICE}}_* settings
├── api/               # v1 (public) + internal routers, deps (the only layer using Depends)
├── application/       # use cases, ports, handlers, jobs, telemetry (business metrics)
├── domain/            # pure rules and errors (no framework imports)
├── infrastructure/    # db (models, uow), clients to other services' contracts, vendor providers
└── contracts_impl.py  # in-process implementation of {{service}}_contracts.api
```

## Run / test in isolation

```bash
uv run --package {{service}}-service pytest services/{{service}}/service
uv run --package {{service}}-service alembic -c services/{{service}}/service/migrations/alembic.ini upgrade head
uv run uvicorn --factory {{service}}_api.main:create_app --port 8000      # standalone run
```

